BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d1-0@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193122Z
DTSTART:20270103T200000Z
DTEND:20270103T223500Z
SUMMARY:Arrive at Pearson
DESCRIPTION:Nonstop flights to the US clear US preclearance in Toronto\, so
  arrive 2.5–3 hours before departure. Even if you don't need a visa\, do
 uble-check passport validity.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d1-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193122Z
DTSTART:20270103T223500Z
DTEND:20270104T083800Z
SUMMARY:AC589 departs
DESCRIPTION:~10 hours nonstop. Try to sleep on Hawaii time on the plane\; H
 awaii is 5 hours behind Toronto.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d1-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193122Z
DTSTART:20270104T083800Z
DTEND:20270104T093000Z
SUMMARY:Land in Honolulu
DESCRIPTION:Domestic arrival\, no immigration again. After baggage claim\, 
 taxi or Uber to the hotel\, ~25–30 min\, ~USD40–50.\n\nGoogle Maps: ht
 tps://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Daniel%20K.%20Inouye%20Inter
 national%20Airport
LOCATION:Daniel K. Inouye International Airport
GEO:21.3330717;-157.9196383
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Daniel K.
  Inouye International Airport":geo:21.3330717,-157.9196383
END:VEVENT
