DTSTAMP:20261119T193122Z
DTSTART:20270104T093000Z
DTEND:20270104T103000Z
SUMMARY:Hotel check-in
DESCRIPTION:Let the hotel know you'll arrive late so the room isn't release
 d.\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hotel%2
 0Renew%2C%20129%20Paoakalani%20Ave%2C%20Honolulu
