UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d4-6@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193122Z
DTSTART:20270107T040000Z
DTEND:20270107T050000Z
SUMMARY:Dinner in Waikīkī
DESCRIPTION:Hanauma Bay tomorrow morning\, so turn in early.\n\nGoogle Maps
 : https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=K%C5%ABhi%C5%8D%20Beach%
 2C%20Honolulu
LOCATION:Kūhiō Beach\, Honolulu
GEO:21.275;-157.82694
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Kūhiō B
 each, Honolulu":geo:21.275,-157.82694
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d5-3@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193122Z
DTSTART:20270107T233000Z
DTEND:20270108T023000Z
SUMMARY:Green Line to the Diamond Head lookout
DESCRIPTION:The Green Line (Diamond Head Line) has a photo stop at Kahala L
 ookout\; step off and you'll see Diamond Head and the ocean\, no hiking. A
  loop takes ~70 min\, and the last afternoon run heads back from the Diamo
 nd Head area around 15:10–15:40\, so don't set out too late. Not going i
 nto the crater: that needs a separate state park reservation\, and without
  the summit there isn't much to see.\n\nGreen Line schedule and stops: htt
 ps://waikikitrolley.com/green-line/\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/m
